	   NHATS does not collect personal information about individuals from this Site except when specifically and knowingly provided by such individuals in conjunction with NHATS research activities. We may automatically record information that your browser sends whenever you visit our Site (e.g., domain name, date and time of your visit, pages visited, operating system of your computer, 
