<div class="modal modal--nhats-refresh fade modal-xl" id="staticBackdrop-conditions-of-use" data-bs-backdrop="static" data-bs-keyboard="false" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="#staticBackdrop-conditions-of-use" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="staticBackdropLabel">Conditions of Use for NHATS Public Use Data</h1>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p><span>By registering to download public use data files, you agree that you:</span></p>

        <ul>
          <li>will NOT attempt to identify study participants</li>
          <li>will NOT transfer NHATS Public Use data to anyone other than staff or students that you have direct responsibility for. Research collaborators and persons not under your direct supervision are required to submit separate applications in order to obtain access to NHATS public data files.</li>
          <li>will NOT upload NHATS or NSOC data to a public large language model or AI platforms including but not limited to ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Copilot, and other similar systems that process data externally and do not guarantee data confidentiality or non-retention.</li>
          <li>will NOT allow others to use your username and password to access this site.</li>
          <li>will use the data only for scientific research purposes and only for aggregate statistical reporting.</li>
          <li>will report immediately any disclosure of study participant identity. (<a href="mailto:nhatsdata@westat.com">NHATSdata@Westat.com</a>)</li>
          <li>will report any flaw or errors in the data or documentation (<a href="mailto:nhatsdata@westat.com">NHATSdata@Westat.com</a>).</li>
          <li>will cite NHATS as the data source in any publications or research based upon these data.</li>
          <li>will notify NHATS of publications based on NHATS Public Use Data by email (<a href="mailto:nhatsdata@westat.com">NHATSdata@Westat.com</a>). Include: authors, title of paper, title of journal, book or other venue where published, date of publication.</li>
          <li>will destroy any downloaded Public Use data file, as well as any derived data files, if requested to do so.</li>
          <li>will notify NHATS about changes in contact information by contacting <a href="mailto:nhatsdata@westat.com">NHATSdata@Westat.com</a>.</li>
        </ul>

      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-register" data-bs-dismiss="modal">
          Close
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
